WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.125
Module four:

2
00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:02.676
decentralized exchanges.

3
00:00:02.676 --> 00:00:07.780
How to swap with a pool instead of an order book, how a formula sets the price,

4
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:13.142
where providers' impermanent loss comes from, and how bots make money on your swap.

5
00:00:14.142 --> 00:00:17.579
A decentralized exchange is a set of smart contracts.

6
00:00:17.579 --> 00:00:22.701
Keeping an order book on a blockchain is expensive, so instead there is a pool:

7
00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.360
a contract holding a stock of two tokens.

8
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.121
Providers deposit both tokens, traders swap with the pool,

9
00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:31.390
and a formula calculates the price.

10
00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:36.318
You connect a wallet and swap tokens straight from it, without registration.
